        "subject": "LU-10973 tests: remove unused LUTF infrastructure",
        "message": "LU-10973 tests: remove unused LUTF infrastructure\n\nThe LUTF infrastructure has been sitting mostly unused since it was\nfirst added in 2021, with only tree-wide fixes in the past few years.\nThere haven't been any LUTF test sessions in Maloo in years.\n\nRemove the tree and its ongoing maintenance.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I1b5282f1a2466ba69be6f5b57f71b72e4a3ebbe5\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65456\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Serguei Smirnov <ssmirnov@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\n"
